_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_019_s4","report_id":"dev_019","text":"Figure 1 shows the accuracy of ResNet-50 by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_019_s5","report_id":"dev_019","text":"ResNet-50 scores 24.5 points higher on AG News than on MNIST.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_019_s6","report_id":"dev_019","text":"ResNet-50 achieves over 75% accuracy on Fashion-MNIST.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_019_s7","report_id":"dev_019","text":"On IMDB, ResNet-50 obtains a accuracy of over 55% (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_019_s8","report_id":"dev_019","text":"Figure 2 shows the training loss.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_019_s9","report_id":"dev_019","text":"At epoch 30, the loss of ViT-S is 0.88.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_019_s10","report_id":"dev_019","text":"At epoch 60, the loss of ViT-S is 0.669.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_019_s11","report_id":"dev_019","text":"At epoch 60, the loss of ViT-S is about 0.6.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_019_s12","report_id":"dev_019","text":"Figure 3 shows the test accuracy during training.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_019_s13","report_id":"dev_019","text":"From epoch 4 to epoch 11, the test accuracy of CNN improves by a relative 20.1%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_019_s14","report_id":"dev_019","text":"CNN attains a test accuracy of 81.8% at epoch 12.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_019_s15","report_id":"dev_019","text":"CNN reaches 73.2% test accuracy at epoch 5.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_019_s16","report_id":"dev_019","text":"On STL-10, Naive Bayes obtains an accuracy of 64.0%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_019_s17","report_id":"dev_019","text":"We note that the training was stable for all models.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"}]}